================================================================================
KEY TAKEAWAY
================================================================================

The complete request lifecycle is:

REQUEST START
      ↓
isLoading = true
      ↓
LOADING UI
      ↓
BACKEND REQUEST
      ↓
+-------------------------+
|                         |
SUCCESS                 FAILURE
|                         |
↓                         ↓
DATA                    ERROR
|                         |
+-----------+-------------+
            ↓
      REQUEST FINISHED
            ↓
     isLoading = false
            ↓
         FINAL UI


Loading state provides users with immediate feedback while React communicates
with the backend.

It turns:

"Nothing is happening."


into:

"The application is working and waiting for the server."


